Rule 2 (input should have integer dtype)
{input : tensor} |= (dtype_(input) = 1) ∨ (dtype_(input) = 2) ∨ (dtype_(input) = 3) ∨ (dtype_(input) = 4) ∨ (dtype_(input) = 5)
>>
Rule 3 (other should have integer dtype)
{other : tensor} |= (dtype_(other) = 1) ∨ (dtype_(other) = 2) ∨ (dtype_(other) = 3) ∨ (dtype_(other) = 4) ∨ (dtype_(other) = 5)
