Rule 14 (input and other should not be complex dtype)
{input : tensor, other : tensor} |= (dtype_(input) ≠ 9) ∧ (dtype_(input) ≠ 10) ∧ (dtype_(other) ≠ 9) ∧ (dtype_(other) ≠ 10)
>>
Rule 22 (input and other should not be half dtype)
{input : tensor, other : tensor} |= (dtype_(input) ≠ 7) ∧ (dtype_(other) ≠ 7)
